1
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:44,960
What?

2
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,380
Since you're here,

3
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,520
dance

4
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,760
for me.

5
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:14,539
What are you doing?

6
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,160
It's just average.

7
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,440
You need to improve.

8
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,120
It's getting late.

9
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,520
I need to go back and rest.

10
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,080
I finally know

11
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,759
why I kissed him that day.

12
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:38,530
I was just lusting after his looks.

13
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:45,720
Desire is just human nature.

14
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:48,720
I just made

15
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:50,720
a mistake that every woman makes.

16
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,480
Can you stop

17
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:23,320
looking at me like a creep?

18
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,440
So what?

19
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:28,240
Appreciating beautiful things

20
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,960
is just human nature.

21
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,520
I'm just following

22
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,240
my heart.

23
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:41,720
What's wrong?

24
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,920
That torn shirt of Huohuo's is gone.

25
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:46,880
I left it on the drying rack

26
00:02:47,079 --> 00:02:48,240
as bait

27
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,560
to see if I could catch the person

28
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,620
secretly mending Huohuo's clothes.

29
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:55,400
Huohuo!

30
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:57,640
Huohuo!

31
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:59,760
Huohuo!

32
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,140
Huo Huo is missing.

33
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,320
Let's call the police.

34
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:06,040
Don't panic.

35
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:08,240
I put a smartwatch in his pocket.

36
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,360
Where is this?

37
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,120
According to the tracker,

38
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,920
he should be in the restaurant
at the village entrance.

39
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:18,920
Let's hurry then.

40
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:29,720
Ms. Qian, why did you bring me here?

41
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,320
I have a surprise for you.

42
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:34,460
Look, we're celebrating your birthday.

43
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,760
Come sit, Xiaobao.

44
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:41,120
But it's not my birthday today.

45
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,520
Sit down, Xiaobao.

46
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,840
Let's put a birthday hat on my Xiaobao

47
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,120
and light a little candle.

48
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:56,280
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

49
00:03:57,079 --> 00:04:00,680
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

50
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:05,480
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

51
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:10,160
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

52
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,040
Happy birthday, Xiaobao.

53
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,560
Xiaobao, what are you waiting for?

54
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,649
Make a wish and blow out the candle.

55
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:18,959
Xiaobao.

56
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,360
Xiaobao, you've always been naughty,

57
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,400
tearing your pants
whenever you go out to play.

58
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:38,520
Look, Mom has mended them for you.

59
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:43,280
So you were the one following me

60
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:45,480
and mending my clothes.

61
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,040
Xiaobao,

62
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,480
can you call me Mom one more time?

63
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:52,920
I have my own mom.

64
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,040
She's traveling

65
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,280
and will be back soon.

66
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:55,360
Thank you for mending my clothes,
Aunt Qian.

67
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,120
Thank you for mending my clothes,
Aunt Qian.

68
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,320
I should go back,

69
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,180
or my brother will scold me again.

70
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,520
Xiaobao, are you leaving Mom?

71
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:03,800
Let go of me.

72
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,640
Don't leave Mom again. Don't go.

73
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:06,200
Let go of my brother.

74
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:08,320
Xiaobao, Xiaobao, Xiaobao.

75
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,690
Let go of my brother.

76
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,520
Huohuo.

77
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:12,600
Aunt Qian,

78
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,040
are you okay?

79
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,320
What exactly are you trying to do?

80
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:15,320
I knew something was off about you

81
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,400
since you first arrived.

82
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:18,320
Is Huohuo your target?

83
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,040
I don't have any bad intentions.

84
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,920
I just came to see Xiaobao,

85
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,040
to see my son.

86
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:27,880
What do you mean?

87
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:30,680
Didn't you say Qiang
didn't want you to suffer,

88
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,440
so you never had kids?

89
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:40,880
I'm sorry.

90
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,360
I lied to you.

91
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:50,000
Honey.

92
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,120
Honey.

93
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,240
What took you so long?

94
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:55,050
Didn't we make it clear before?

95
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,880
There's nothing to divide anyway.

96
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:57,640
Alright, alright.

97
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:58,320
Look,

98
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:00,200
we got the divorce certificate.

99
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,040
I know.

100
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,720
After junior high,

101
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:06,000
you worked to support his studies.

102
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,440
I should thank you

103
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,120
for raising him up.

104
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:12,160
But people move up in the world.

105
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:12,960
You know

106
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:15,600
you don't deserve him now.

107
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,560
Take this money

108
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:22,620
as compensation for taking care of him
all these years.

109
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,720
Honey, today is a good day.

110
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,800
Let's go get registered.

111
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:32,600
I suppose you'll give us
your blessing too, right?

112
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:38,640
Let's go.

113
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:41,100
What are you looking at?
Still hung up on him?

114
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,920
Xiaoyan, don't take it to heart.

115
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,240
It's his fault.

116
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:49,320
You scrimped and saved
to put him through school.

117
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:51,600
You were both a wife and a mother to him.

118
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:53,440
Then he turned around,
hooked up with the boss's daughter,

119
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:54,360
and dumped you.

120
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,520
But we still have to live our own lives,

121
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,640
right?

122
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,600
I happen to be single too.

123
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,760
Recently, I pulled some strings

124
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,520
and became a security guard
at a government agency.

125
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:04,320
It's a pretty stable job.

126
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,280
Let's just settle down together.

127
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:09,240
It'll be my first marriage
and your second.

128
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,240
I have a small place.

129
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:12,320
If you don't mind,
you can move in with me.

130
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:14,840
I really can't afford
a bride price, though.

131
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,600
But I just want to find a wife,

132
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,040
start a family,

133
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,240
and have a chubby son.

134
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,240
Let's build a life together.

135
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,240
What do you say?

136
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,480
Don't get caught in the rain.

137
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:25,120
Hurry up

138
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:26,360
and get on.

139
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:28,360
Life is

140
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,920
like my e-bike,

141
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,120
full of ups and downs.

142
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,080
Doctor,

143
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,720
I beg you, please save Xiaobao.

144
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,480
Please think of another way.

145
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:41,920
My baby is only four.

146
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,800
Doctor, I'm begging you.

147
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,680
Xiaobao's mom,

148
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:47,680
the car accident caused
severe brain damage.

149
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,480
We've done everything we could.

150
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,810
I'm sorry for your loss.

151
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,360
Xiaobao's mom,

152
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,880
there's a situation.

153
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:01,520
There is another child in the hospital

154
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,000
who is in critical condition

155
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,640
and urgently needs a heart transplant.

156
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,520
Would you be willing

157
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:08,930
to donate your child's organs?

158
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,160
This way, perhaps

159
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,880
another child could survive,

160
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:15,930
and it would be a continuation
of Xiaobao's life.

161
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,680
Who gave you the right

162
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,200
to donate my son's heart?

163
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:27,520
You didn't even leave his body intact
when he died!

164
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:29,120
What kind of mother are you?

165
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,320
Do you even deserve to be one?

166
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,440
You're an illiterate
on your second marriage!

167
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,570
If it weren't for me,

168
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,520
who would marry a jinx like you?

169
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:37,850
You couldn't even protect your own child!

170
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,120
And you write those crappy poems?

171
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:45,480
You didn't even finish middle school,
yet you write poetry?

172
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,520
Dreaming of being a poet

173
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,800
or a writer?

174
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:48,520
Pathetic!

175
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:50,960
Ever since Xiaobao left us,

176
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:54,360
Zhang Qiang beats me whenever he's upset.

177
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:57,520
I miss my child so much.

178
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,240
I later found out that

179
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,300
on the day Xiaobao donated his heart,

180
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,480
only one child

181
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,280
had surgery at that hospital.

182
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,480
It was Huohuo.

183
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:08,800
I wondered if Xiaobao's heart

184
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,920
might be inside Huohuo.

185
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,320
That's why I came here.

186
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:16,520
Today is our Xiaobao's birthday.

187
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:19,520
I just wanted to celebrate
my child's birthday.

188
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:23,120
My brother did have surgery
at the hospital four years ago,

189
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,960
but it wasn't a heart transplant.

190
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,620
It was just for appendicitis.

191
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:29,880
This is it.

192
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:43,120
I'm sorry.

193
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,370
I was being foolish.

194
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:45,440
I'll leave now.

195
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,200
Ms. Qian!

196
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,360
You bitch,

197
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,320
so you hid here.

198
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,920
Made me look all over for you.

199
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,360
Why did you push Ms. Qian?

200
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:55,640
You brat,

201
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:57,240
you're the one
who took our Xiaobao's heart,

202
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:57,720
aren't you?

203
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,520
What are you doing?

204
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,640
I haven't even settled
the score with you yet.

205
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:00,300
Today, I...

206
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:01,760
I swear today I'll...

207
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,800
You bitch,

208
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,160
how dare you hit me!

209
00:10:07,160 --> 00:10:08,760
If you keep making trouble,
we'll call the police.

210
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:10,920
Call them. She's my wife.

211
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,800
I can do whatever I want.

212
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,840
It's none of your business.

213
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,170
Mind your own business.

214
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:18,120
A marriage certificate is not
your get-out-of-jail-free card.

215
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,760
If you dare to mess around again,

216
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,020
we won't go easy on you.

217
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,080
Aunt Qian, let's go.

218
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:25,840
Let's go.

219
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,480
Zhang Qiang came to me

220
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:39,360
just to force me to go back
and have a baby with him.

221
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,360
But we're not young anymore.

222
00:10:41,680 --> 00:10:43,560
We really can't have one.

223
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,360
I don't know

224
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:48,160
where he got this weird folk prescription.

225
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:50,360
He said as long as I follow it,

226
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:53,560
Xiaobao will be reincarnated
into our family.

227
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:56,120
I really couldn't take it anymore,

228
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:57,600
so I escaped

229
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,760
and came to Yunbian.

230
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,490
This man is not only abusive

231
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,960
but also superstitious.

232
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:07,160
Why don't you divorce him?

233
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:10,020
He's really a living hell.

234
00:11:10,560 --> 00:11:12,440
You really need
to think it over carefully.

235
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,240
Do you really want to keep suffering

236
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,800
in this living hell?

237
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:19,600
But I've already been divorced once.

238
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:21,680
If I do it again,

239
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,120
what will people think of me?

240
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:28,360
Besides, what if
the next guy is even worse?

241
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:30,960
If I just endure and compromise now,

242
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,520
I can still barely get by.

243
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:37,320
Anyway, I'm used to enduring it
after all these years.

244
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:43,560
Ms. Qian, blind compromise
won't earn you respect,

245
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:45,720
nor will it bring back the life you want.

246
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,240
Your repeated compromises

247
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,600
will only make him escalate his abuse,

248
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:49,680
trampling on your dignity,

249
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:50,440
hurting your body,

250
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:51,840
and torturing your mind.

251
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,890
When you first came,

252
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:55,320
you kept telling us

253
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:57,580
how incredibly happy your marriage was.

254
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,840
You've started to numb

255
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,240
and brainwash yourself.

256
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:03,280
You're trying to package
the abuse as love.

257
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:05,880
But it's all fake.

258
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,240
You can't keep deceiving yourself,

259
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,680
and you can't keep making excuses for him.

260
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,560
You know what?

261
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:17,080
Ms. Qian,

262
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:20,280
fighting back isn't actually
as hard as you think.

263
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:21,680
If you just risk it all

264
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:23,250
and stand up to him once,

265
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:25,320
you'll find he's just a paper tiger

266
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,760
who bullies the weak.

267
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,000
Huohuo.

268
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:41,560
I'm not Huohuo right now.

269
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:43,960
I'm Ms. Qian's Xiaobao.

270
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:46,680
I want to fulfill her wish.

271
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,920
Today is Xiaobao's birthday.

272
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:56,560
Come on, everyone
wish me a happy birthday.

273
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:59,360
Happy birthday to you.

274
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:03,200
Happy birthday to you.

275
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:07,480
Happy birthday to you.

276
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:11,720
Happy birthday to you.

277
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,760
Xiaobao hopes Mom

278
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:24,360
can live a happy life from now on,

279
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:26,560
do what she wants to do,

280
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:29,080
